. Heavy Weapons is stored as the catalog W.P. Heavy Military Weapons, a reading: the catalog also holds W.P. Heavy Military Weapons. Read Sensory Equipment is Sensory Equipment; General Athletics is Athletics (general); Body Building is Body Building & Weight Lifting. Four Military skills and four others is eight related picks with a floor of four in Military. Science: Astronomy and Math only is Astronomy and both Mathematics rows. Wilderness: Hunting is a catalog row with no percentage. No horsemanship: City troops are not trained to ride (printed 157). Cowboy, Espionage and Rogue: None are honoured by leaving the categories out. Hand to Hand: Expert upgraded to Martial Arts for one related skill is costs martial_arts 1; no other style is priced. || EQUIPMENT: one weapon for each W.P. is four weapons of the player''s choice; a jacket, a full brimmed hat, a baseball cap, a web belt, a radio communicator with a 5 mile (8 km) range, a bedroll, an entrenching tool and the six reloads have no Rifts catalog row and are in GM Notes. The text layer prints ah- filter for air filter. || MONEY: starts with 1D6x$1000 in personal savings (the text layer prints lD6x$1000); the monthly salary of $1500, +$100 per level, is in GM Notes."
